  "body": "If you are looking for a single-level home that feels easy, practical and genuinely well thought out, this one deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nSet on a freehold corner site in Gulf Harbour, this brick and tile home offers the kind of layout buyers are always asking for. Three bedrooms, two bathrooms, a separate office, two living areas, internal access garaging and covered outdoor living all come together in a way that simply makes sense.\r\n\r\nInside, the kitchen sits at the heart of the home, connecting naturally with the dining and family area. It is clean, modern and functional, with breakfast bar seating and good everyday flow. The second lounge gives the home proper flexibility, whether you need a kids' space, media room, quiet retreat or a bit of separation when life gets busy.\r\n\r\nThe bedrooms are well placed, with the main bedroom offering a comfortable retreat and the additional rooms giving good options for family, guests or work-from-home living. The separate office is a real bonus, especially for buyers needing a dedicated space without sacrificing a bedroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, the covered deck adds another usable living zone. It is the kind of space that works for morning coffee, afternoon sun, weekend BBQs or simply sitting back and enjoying the outlook.\r\n\r\nThis is not trying to be overcomplicated.\r\n\r\nIt is freehold, single-level, brick and tile, low maintenance and seriously easy to like.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n* Freehold corner site\r\n* Single-level brick and tile home\r\n* Four bedrooms\r\n* Master bedroom with large walk-in wardrobe\r\n* Two bathrooms\r\n* Two separate living areas\r\n* Open-plan kitchen with walk in pantry, dining and family area\r\n* Covered outdoor entertaining deck\r\n* Low-maintenance grounds\r\n* Elevated outlook and good natural light\r\n\r\nFor families, downsizers, professional couples or anyone wanting a modern Gulf Harbour home without the unnecessary drama, this is well worth a look.\r\n\r\nClean, solid and easy living, this one just makes sense.",
